WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Ask some Hindus what
their religion is called,

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:06.160
and they may give another
name: sanatana dharma,

3
00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.960
the eternal way.

4
00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:11.860
The word Hinduism came
into English around 1800.

5
00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:14.680
Its roots go back to the name of a river.

6
00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.800
Under that one word
sit devotees of Vishnu,

7
00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.260
of Shiva, of the Goddess, and many more.

8
00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:24.500
So is Hinduism one
religion, many religions,

9
00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:26.200
or a way of life?

10
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.140
In this mission, you'll trace
where the word came from,

11
00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:32.190
and why it groups so
many traditions together.

12
00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:35.230
Then you'll weigh up the
arguments that it is one religion,

13
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.570
and the arguments that it is not.

14
00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:41.530
Your mission: weigh up whether
Hinduism is a single religion,

15
00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.960
many religions, or a way of life.
